{"total_count":46,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318","id":5925675973,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYTKjxQ","number":318,"title":"Framing oracle builder defects: columns across a wall step pass as buildable but fail checks; build crash when a hole edge midpoint hits another ring's vertex","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-10-19T14:23:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:06:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# 下角材 oracle 建構端缺陷(第 20 輪審查發現,這輪不修)\n\n> 來源:第 20 輪 #251 審查(審查 4e1f1161)。第 20 輪的修法(C7 自己重建每個 P-182 候選、手算對照組、引文檢查)**沒有動這兩個缺陷**,\n> 只把〈候選因這些缺陷被淘汰〉的理由寫出來(`P182_NO_FEASIBLE_CANDIDATE` 的 candidates 與 trace 把衝突碼、檢查失敗碼分開寫)。\n> 程式:`geometry-core/framing-template/oracle/framing_oracle.py`。重現腳本放在 `framing-oracle-gaps/round20/exp/`(用環境變數 `ORACLE_DIR` 指到 oracle 目錄)。\n> 所有座標單位 mm,房間以外框(及孔)頂點列表表示,排法以名稱表示(例:左上起鋪,板長沿 X)。\n\n## 缺陷 1:柱的 x 範圍碰到或跨過牆階的 x 座標時,建構端說可施工,完整 check() 卻紅\n\n**現象**:`build()` 回傳的衝突清單是空的(可施工),可是 `check()` 報 C3_EDGE_UNSUPPORTED、C6_END_NOT_ON_TIMBER、C8_END_NOT_ON_ONE_TIMBER、C8_I19_BOUNDARY_END(視房間再加 C4、C10、C5、C8_I19_PRIORITY)。\nP-182 救不到:最後一條主支縫的主支寬度裡沒有擋料時候選集合只有原縫位,不另外判可行與否,照舊交出去(`build()` 的 `if pending:` 之外)。\n\n**最小重現**(左上起鋪,板長沿 X):\n\n```python\nroom = {\"outer\": [[0,0],[4100,0],[4100,3661],[3000,3661],[3000,3700],[0,3700]],\n        \"holes\": [[[2600,3444],[3000,3444],[3000,3644],[2600,3644]]]}\nr = build(room, layout, p)        # r[\"conflicts\"] == [],最後一條主支縫 3620,沒有 p182 trace\ncheck(r, p)                       # C3_EDGE_UNSUPPORTED(3 處)、C6_END_NOT_ON_TIMBER(2 處)、C8_END_NOT_ON_ONE_TIMBER(2 處)、C8_I19_BOUNDARY_END\n```\n\n- 柱 x 2600–3000 的右面剛好在牆階的垂直牆 x=3000 上:失敗的帶子都在 x 2973–3027、y 3634–3661 附近(柱上緣的沿柱料停在 x=2973、牆階的邊界材 [2973,3000]×[3661,3700] 與柱面料 [3000,3027]×[3444,3607] 之間沒有料接住)。\n- 牆階的垂直牆改在 x=2900(柱 x 2600–3000 跨過它)結果相同;改在 x=3100(柱完全在牆階的左邊)就全過。所以條件是〈柱的 x 範圍碰到或跨過牆階的 x 座標〉。\n- 另一類:柱上有牆階且 y 範圍跨過牆階高度時,原縫位的併料(custom、優先級 3)端面頂到柱面料(優先級 3),`C8_I19_PRIORITY` 紅(例:外框 [[0,0],[4100,0],[4100,3662],[2600,3662],[2600,4000],[0,4000]],柱 x 1000–1400、y 3606–3806,左上 X,原縫位 3667)。\n\n**頻率**(審查員 fz20.py 隨機房間,種子 1–4 各 150 間,每間 8 種排法 × 原房與上下、左右鏡像):可施工卻檢查失敗共 110 次:\n72 次都含 C3、C6、C8_END_NOT_ON_ONE_TIMBER、C8_I19_BOUNDARY_END(其中 60 次另帶 C8_I19_PRIORITY、12 次不帶;有的另帶 C4 或 C10);\nC8_I19_PRIORITY 單獨 12 次;C11_MAIN_NOT_BUTTED 單獨 12 次(同 README〈已知缺口〉那條既有缺陷);C5_MAIN_GAP 單獨 8 次;C10 加 C5 加 C8_I19_PRIORITY 4 次;C10 加 C8_I19_PRIORITY 2 次\n(逐筆見 `round20/baseline/fz20_*_150.txt`)。第 20 輪前後這個數字完全相同(`round20/after/`)。\n\n**為什麼現有的掃描沒看到**:`selftest.py` 的 P-182 候選掃描四族(t16、t14、t10、t4)取的房型裡,可施工的排法在 P-182 把〈檢查失敗〉當成淘汰理由之後,\n要嘛被退到別的縫位、要嘛報 `P182_NO_FEASIBLE_CANDIDATE`,所以缺陷被排法決策蓋住;沒有擋料的房間(上面的最小重現)則根本不在掃描的房型裡。\n\n**待判**:要修的是建構端(柱面料、沿牆料、牆階邊界材在 x 方向的接法)還是把這種房間判成不可施工;物理上這種房間能不能施工沒有確認。\n\n## 缺陷 2:孔(柱)的水平邊中點的座標剛好等於外框某個頂點的座標,`build()` 當掉\n\n**現象**:`AssertionError`,位置在 `build()` 的邊界材迴圈裡 `plus = reg.inside(*pt((s0 + s1) / 2, e + 0.5))`(HEAD 4e1f1161 是 framing_oracle.py:416;現在的行號有移動),\n往下是 `Region.inside` → `Region.section` → `Region._ring_section` 的 `assert len(vals) % 2 == 0`:`section(0, x)` 在 x 剛好等於某個頂點的 x 座標(牆線)時,穿過該頂點的水平邊會被算 0 次或 1 次,數目變成奇數。\n\n**最小重現**(左上起鋪,板長沿 X 或 Y 都會):\n\n```python\nSTEP45 = [[0,0],[4100,0],[4100,3655],[2600,3655],[2600,3700],[0,3700]]     # x=2600 是牆階的垂直牆\nroom = {\"outer\": STEP45, \"holes\": [[[2500,500],[2700,500],[2700,800],[2500,800]]]}   # 孔的水平邊 x 2500–2700,中點 2600\nbuild(room, layout, p)            # AssertionError\n```\n\n- 孔離牆階很遠也當(孔在 y 500–800,牆階在 y 3655 以上),所以只和座標比對有關。孔 x 2400–2800(中點也是 2600)同樣當。\n- 沒有孔的同一個外框正常(45 mm 牆階,左上 X 3614、左上 Y 3667)。\n- 檢查端有類似的保護:`section_both_sides`(牆線上取兩側都在室內的部分);建構端這一處沒有。\n\n**注意**:這是建構端對任意房間的穩健性問題;審查員的 fz20.py 在 `buildcrash` 欄會數到(種子 1–4 各 150 間:96、144、192、24 次,第 20 輪前後相同)。\n\n## 另一個值得知道的檢查端盲點(不是這兩個缺陷,順便記)\n\n`SPAN_PARTLY_RC`(建構端報的衝突碼:一跨的一部分落在 RC 裡)在檢查端沒有對應的檢查,完整 check() 對這種候選全過。\nP-182 的 C7 遇到〈重建後有衝突碼、檢查全過〉的候選會標 `C7_P182_FAIL_UNCONFIRMED`(不是默默當成失敗)。\nfz20.py 種子 1、2、4 各有 6 次不可施工的排法帶這個標記(第 20 輪前後相同),例:外框 [[0,0],[4100,0],[4100,3708],[1750,3708],[1750,3655],[450,3655],[450,3734],[0,3734]],右上起鋪板長沿 Y。\n\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/318/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248","id":5855811504,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXQiXsA","number":248,"title":"[架構] 幾何核心與木工模板解耦(GEO-261)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":48,"created_at":"2026-10-14T21:16:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:06:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 目標\r\n\r\n把 geometry-axiom 的核心改成**與領域無關的幾何概念**,木工知識(角材、面材、主支／副支、板材尺寸、承接門檻等)改為**第一個被套用、可以解耦的模板**。依賴只能單向:模板依賴核心,核心不依賴模板。\r\n\r\n## 使用者原話\r\n\r\n2026-10-12 的產品方向(🔒,全文與其餘原話見 #246 補登的決策佇列第 1 項):\r\n\r\n(使用者貼上的協調 agent 文字,非使用者原話:「這幾天寫進公理層的 PF-0(面材鋪滿)和 K1(裁切餘料),把大量木工細節直接寫進了核心公理。例如主支和副支的角色、壁邊材、8 mm 承接門檻、鋸縫、餘料標記。原本的公理層也已經有不少以木工命名的條文。機制本身大多是通用的,像引用、網格、交易、身分,但寫法和命名都綁在木工上。」)\r\n\r\n> 這些可以存在裡面 但是是能夠解耦 並且是第一個被套用的部份\r\n\r\n（對話紀錄第 6989 行，台北 2026-10-12 01:07）\r\n\r\n> 或者說這些也是早晚要做的\"模板\"\r\n\r\n（對話紀錄第 6995 行，台北 2026-10-12 01:08）\r\n\r\n2026-10-15 使用者發現介面仍以木工概念為主,並要求排入工作排程(🔒):\r\n\r\n> .... \r\n> 這個應用 是 geometry axiom  \r\n> 所以 角材 和 面材 是幾何裡面的概念嗎\r\n\r\n（對話紀錄第 16554 行，台北 2026-10-15 05:12）\r\n\r\n> 還是說之前提到的請求  木工領域知識 只是 geometry axiom 專案中的模板 這個還沒改版?\r\n\r\n（對話紀錄第 16574 行，台北 2026-10-15 05:14）\r\n\r\n> 那我要確定讓這項在工作排程 內 幫我安排\r\n\r\n（對話紀錄第 16600 行，台北 2026-10-15 05:15）\r\n\r\n## 現況(2026-10-15)\r\n\r\n- 10-12 的決定之後,只套用在新工作:\r\n  - 下角材模式(#221)設計成模板層,核心不動。\r\n  - #203、#204 的現場規則放進模板。\r\n- 既有核心沒有改:\r\n  - 公理層以木工語言寫成,例如 D7 角材、D26 材料種類 timber/panel,以及主支、副支、邊界材等角色。\r\n  - 前端到處是木工名詞與木工預設值。例如參數範本「寬 × 長」(915×1830)與「W × H」(27×33),在幾何上是同一件事(兩個長度),只差木工預設值。\r\n- 之前沒有任何工單追蹤這件事。協調 agent 曾問解耦順序,使用者沒有選,之後也沒有追問,這是協調 agent 的疏失。\r\n\r\n## 排程\r\n\r\n| 階段 | 內容 | 負責 | 產出 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| 0 盤點 | 逐條列出公理層與介面中的木工概念,每項標出:幾何本質、木工專屬部分、搬到模板層會牽動哪些條文／測試／場景檔格式。只讀,不改程式。 | ChatGPT 研究工人(R18,優先) | 本 issue 留言 |\r\n| 1 提案 | 依盤點寫解耦提案,內容含:概念對照表(幾何名稱 ↔ 木工模板名稱)、核心要改的條文、場景檔相容、測試影響、可選的切片順序。經對抗審查。 | Claude 整理、opus 審查 | 提案文件 PR |\r\n| 2 拍板 | 使用者決定範圍與順序。動到 `公理層.md` 與 🔒 的部分一律要使用者明示。 | 使用者 | 決策佇列 |\r\n| 3 實作 | 依拍板分片實作,每片走合併列車跑 7 項。 | Codex | 各片 PR |\r\n\r\n## 規則(拍板前)\r\n\r\n- 進行中的工作(PF 系列、列車)照現行 SSOT 繼續,不因本 issue 暫停。\r\n- 新工作不得再把木工常數或木工預設值寫進核心;要放在模板層,或標明待解耦。\r\n- 參數範本等小地方,等提案拍板後一併改,不零星先改。\r\n\r\n帳本工單:GEO-261。\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/248/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316","id":5917959557,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYLzlhQ","number":316,"title":"GEO-261 follow-up: dead world_footprint_collides and I11 mutation coverage at the other two same-surface filters","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-19T04:44:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:06:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**起因**:GEO-261 整合分支(PR #288)的帳本重產時，突變 M13(I11:碰撞只看同承載面)存活。`9c467933` 已把 M13 改打到實際執行的那行(`current_geometry.c` 的 `resolve_auto_span` 收集障礙物處)。查原因時，另外發現兩件事，這裡追蹤。\n\n**1. 死碼**\n- `current_geometry.c` 的 `world_footprint_collides` 自 `51e9045b` 起沒有任何呼叫點。這是靜態驗證的結果：把它整段刪掉,MSVC 仍能編譯並連結，核心場景 165/165。\n- 它委派的 W API `wood_contact_footprint_collides`,只剩這個死函式和 `tests/geo261_contact_world_harness.c` 在呼叫。\n- `test_geo261_wood_contact_world::test_five_real_main_consumers_delegate…` 把 `world_footprint_collides` 當成「真實呼叫者」,這與事實不符。\n- 二選一:\n  - (a) 刪掉死碼，並把這個測試改成驗證真實呼叫點;\n  - (b) 保留，但改正測試的宣稱。\n\n**2. I11 另外兩個檢查點的變異覆蓋**\n- `geometry-core/references.inc:656`(明寫放置的兩兩檢查)和 `geometry-templates/woodworking/native/world_validation.c:66`(重驗)各有一個同承載面過濾。\n- 目前 M37 只覆蓋重驗的配對迴圈。\n- 要逐一確認這兩處各自有沒有變異能打到，沒有就補上，並附「拿掉就紅」的證據。\n\n**排程**:GEO-261 合入 main 之後再做，避免讓整份帳本又過期一次(重產約 2 小時)。\n\n證據在本機 `D:/geometry-axiom-work/m13-reanchor-20261019/`,也見 #288 的【Claude 補強】留言。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/316/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335","id":6002059022,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABZcAnDg","number":335,"title":"Place two mutually-butting boundaries on a thin wall step (#318 reading A positive B)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-23T17:00:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:00:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#318 閱讀 A 核可的正例 B(13 mm 薄牆階,兩支壁邊材端頭互頂)在原生 CLI 裡做不出來。依使用者 2026-10-24 的選擇:#318 的 W 與 oracle 政策先推進,本題另開工單。設計與條文差異未定案前不實作。\n\n## 實測(原生 core,分支 claude/sharp-bohr-9flfm7 @ 074a004a)\n\n外輪廓 (0,0) (500,0) (500,13) (1000,13) (1000,1000) (0,1000);e0 是下段牆,e2 是牆階上段。兩支 27×20 boundary。\n\n```\nsurface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 500,0 500,13 1000,13 1000,1000 0,1000\ntimber 1 27 20 role boundary\ntimber 2 27 20 role boundary\nplace 1 on 1 at-face e0 +u +n\nplace 2 on 1 at-face e2 +u +n\n```\n\n- 先放 timber 1(e0):拒絕,第 5 行「R6/I5/I6 timber 1: 跨距終點沒有擋面（端面懸空）」。u=500 的端頭只對著 13 mm RC 與 14 mm 空氣,timber 2 還沒放,沒有「已放」的料可頂。\n- 先放 timber 2(e2):timber 2 本身成功,但它越過凹角延伸到 u=0(L=1000,原點 (0,13),足跡 v 13–40)。接著放 timber 1 拒絕:「R6/I5/I6 timber 1: 中線上沒有任何合法跨距」。\n- 只放 timber 2:接受,L=1000。\n\noracle 的同一幾何(tests/test_geo318_reading_a_oracle.py 的 step 夾具)判 PARTIAL、可施工;產品放不出來。\n\n## 原因\n\n- I19 例外三與 R6(d) 要求端面頂到「已放」角材。兩支的端頭都要靠對方:先放的那一支一定看不到另一支。\n- 自動長度會讓先放的 e2 那支越過凹角延伸,佔掉 e0 那支的位置。\n- QUESTIONS Q318-1 先前靜態讀到的路徑風險:reference_rebuild() 先把所有角材的 placed 清掉再依原順序評估,接觸來源略過尚未 placed 的料;場景載入逐行套用,沒有批次。\n\n## 待設計(交使用者核可,不在此代決)\n\n- 同一筆候選交易一起放兩支,以交易結束時的世界共同驗證端面(I8 有完整候選交易);要定義兩支互為長度來源時的求解方式,以及場景檔／CLI 怎麼表示同一批。\n- 或調整重建／接觸來源的順序語意。\n\n任何一種都要先寫逐條條文差異給使用者看稿。\n\n## 驗收(定案後)\n\n- 兩種順序與同批放置的正反例,loadfile／dump／重建往返一致。\n- 拿掉新路徑要紅(0/1/0)。\n- 不得把未放的料當已放,不放寬 I22、I20／R18。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/335/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1236702,"client_id":"Iv23liqTIFEtdIu6Vn1r","slug":"claude","node_id":"A_kwHOBIuudM4AEt7e","owner":{"login":"anthropics","id":76263028,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc2MjYzMDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropics/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Claude","description":"Run Claude Code from your GitHub Pull Requests and Issues to respond to reviewer feedback, fix CI errors, or modify code, turning it into a virtual teammate that works alongside your development pipelines.\r\n\r\nThis is built on the publicly available Claude Code SDK.","external_url":"https://anthropic.com/claude-code","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/claude","created_at":"2025-04-30T17:54:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:04:00Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","administration":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"write","issues":"write","members":"read","merge_queues":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","repository_hooks":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["branch_protection_rule","check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","discussion","discussion_comment","issues","issue_comment","merge_group","merge_queue_entry","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","push","release","repository_ruleset","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314","id":5910819405,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYE_yTQ","number":314,"title":"Implement the one-axis grid stagger rule (D10b/I24) on every native commit path, including R60 card commits","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-10-18T14:56:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:35:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**背景**:#309 已採納 #260 A/B 條文(D10b、I24、D29、R22,以及白話版 A5),內容是「同一份網格系統只准一軸有相位差」。依決策佇列「2026-10-16 #240 S6」節的寫法，條文寫入之後才實作。目前 main 和列車 #312 都只改了條文與 Python 執行器的版本宣告;原生核心(`.c`/`.inc`)還沒有任何「提交時比較相位差軸數」的檢查。\n\n**要實作的內容**(以採納後的 `公理層.md` 為準，不另立規則):\n- 新提交(編輯)若讓網格的兩軸都有相位差，就拒絕，並在診斷訊息中指名條號。\n- 在兩軸都已錯開的舊網格上，若提交後仍是兩軸、且相位差數值有變，也拒絕。決策佇列「2026-10-18 #260 最終文字確認」節第 2 題:要改，須在同一筆先移除一軸。\n- 整體取代(開檔、載入、恢復)不檢查，舊的兩軸檔案照樣可以開。\n- 所有提交路徑都要涵蓋，**包括 #298/#312 新增的 R60 整卡提交路徑**(opus 審查 #312 的建議第 5 項)。\n\n**驗收**:\n- 每條提交路徑各有正例和反例，失敗訊息要指得出病因。\n- 附突變：拿掉檢查要紅。\n- 舊的兩軸 fixture 仍然可以開，需要時用 `make_fixture.sh` 從發佈的 main 產生。\n- 跑 WSL 7 項。\n\n**排程**:等 GEO-261(#288)合入 main 之後再做。GEO-261 改動了原生核心的提交結構，現在做，整合時還得再移植一次。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/314/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205","id":5803955142,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWfFTxg","number":205,"title":"[功能提案][下角材模式] 平釘天花一鍵下角材：第一個木工模板需要、規格尚缺的規則","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12244016589,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAAC2czdzQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:34:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T14:47:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 目標\r\n\r\n和木工師傅看同一張平面圖，指定一個既有的封閉面（例如客廳天花），選「平釘天花板」模式，骨架依規則一次產生，不用一根一根擺。\r\n\r\n依使用者 2026-10-12 的產品方向，這是**第一個木工模板**：\r\n\r\n- 可以放在公理裡，但要能解耦。\r\n- 依賴只能單向：模板 → 核心。\r\n\r\n> 「這些可以存在裡面 但是是能夠解耦 並且是第一個被套用的部份」\r\n\r\n## 規則（使用者 2026-10-12 確認）\r\n\r\n1. **排板**：從起鋪牆整片鋪，裁切只在對牆，不置中。\r\n2. **沿邊料**：牆和獨立柱四周都要有沿邊料。副支的端面要頂到角材才能固定，不能直接頂 RC。\r\n3. **主支**：壓在板長邊縫上（915 向，間距 917），整支連續、**不可斷開**，兩端坐在牆邊的邊界材上。主支線不得碰到獨立柱或柱邊料；碰到就是排板衝突，要改起鋪角、板長方向或偏移（同開口：位置給定、不可切骨，反推起鋪）。\r\n4. **副支**：固定好的主支上以同一間距畫記號，副支照記號接，端面頂主支側面。\r\n   - 等分數 n = ⌈完整格（1830 + 2 = 1832）÷ 間距上限⌉。\r\n   - 上限取 450 時 n = 5，中間 4 支。450 是使用者平釘工法知識裡的副支防垂上限，規格裡沒有。\r\n   - 記號從縫中心線起算、取整數 mm，間距 366 / 367 交錯；每第 5 個記號落在板端縫上，並延續到對牆的裁切格。\r\n   - 驗收只看中心距 ≤ 上限，差 1 mm 不影響。\r\n\r\n## 規格現況\r\n\r\n依據：main e50e8d18（M）與已採納、未合併的 PF-0 堆疊 `axiom/stack-clarify-20261011` 7ad9cef1（S）。\r\n\r\n| 需要 | 規格現況 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 板中間支撐依間距上限自動產生 | D45（S:635）與 R45（S:1646）的建議都不含板中間支撐；#128 Q45 明寫首版只推板縫下、中間支撐另議。`support_step`、`by_span 條件等分` 列在 §四未定案（M:1170）。子網格這條路被整除保護與 PF-0 排除擋住，見 #203。 |\r\n| 一次產生整面骨架 | PF-0 R45 由使用者一次明選一組候選（S:1647），但只含沿邊料與板縫下的料。D58 重複開間（S:548、S:778–795）可在一個實例內把單一開間套到多支主支與多條副支線；副支線只能是 D6 參考線或主格格線，不收子格線（S:786）。所以中間副支的每條線目前都要人手定義。 |\r\n| 獨立柱四周的柱邊料；主支線不碰柱 | I19 允許端面直接頂柱面，所以副支頂 RC、主支被柱截斷都判合法；PF-0 R45(3) 不產生孔環邊料。柱邊料本身表達得出來：與主支平行的宣告 primary、垂直的宣告 secondary（I21），優先級合法。見 #204。 |\r\n| 收邊太窄時把最後一道縫往內挪 | 沒有自動規則。對牆剩不到約 40 mm（1.5 × 角材寬 27 = 40.5）時，最後一道縫上的主支會撞進對牆的邊界主支：那面牆跟主支平行，依 I21（M:675–676）與 R45(3)（S:1637）是邊界主支。PF-0 預覽會列出 I11 不成立並把承接不足標紅（S:637）。手動繞法可能是用 D6 參考線讓那支主支往內偏幾 mm，承接仍 ≥ 8 mm（推論，未實測）。現場做法是把最後一片整板裁短幾 mm，留約 40 mm 收邊條。 |\r\n\r\nPF-0 已能表達的部分：起排點可在任一整數位置，縫線索引 k∈Z（S:605–606、S:614），所以從任一面牆起鋪都沒問題。\r\n\r\n## 對照\r\n\r\n- 本機有一份離線 demo，照上述規則實作並附規則檢查，含兩個反例：「關掉柱邊料 → 副支端面頂 RC 被擋」、「改起鋪角使主支線碰柱 → 排板衝突，並列出不衝突的起鋪角與方向」。\r\n- 它不在 repo 內（`demo/` 被 allowlist `.gitignore` 排除），需要時另行提交。\r\n\r\n## 下一步\r\n\r\n寫「下角材模式（木工模板）」提案，內容包括條文差異、物理理由，以及核心與模板的切分。提案先經對抗審查，再交使用者拍板，通過才實作。#203、#204 的核心部分要先定。\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/205/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203","id":5803953738,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWfFOSg","number":203,"title":"[公理][子網格] 平釘天花的板中間支撐：整除保護與 PF-0 排除讓標準 1830 板無法用子網格，需定案依間距上限放支撐","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:34:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:44:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 需求（平釘天花，使用者 2026-10-12 確認）\n\n915 × 1830 的板、縫 2 mm。1830 方向：\n\n- 每片整板中間放 4 支副支，分 5 段。\n- 真正要守的只是「副支中心距 ≤ 間距上限」，差 1 mm 不影響。\n\n> 「雖然說是固定模數但是差1mm的差異也不影響阿 更應該說都在間距上限以內」\n\n## 現行規格擋住這件事的地方\n\n依據：main e50e8d18（M）與已採納、未合併的 PF-0 堆疊 `axiom/stack-clarify-20261011` 7ad9cef1（S）。\n\n1. **整除保護（刻意的決定）**\n   - I25（M:719）：「每軸 (hi − lo) 必須可被 n 整除；不可整除即拒絕，不捨入」。\n   - I35（M:779）、R3（M:889）也有同樣的要求。#57 的 V1 範圍明寫「有效 pitch 必須能整數毫米等分」、「一般等距600 mm分7份必須拒絕」。\n   - 面材來源的父格依縫中心線形成（D19，M:263），所以：\n     - 完整格是 1830 + 2 = 1832，分 5 段是 366.4，被拒絕。\n     - 起鋪牆那一格是 1830 + ⌊g/2⌋，縫 2 或 3 mm 時都是 **1831，是質數**，n = 2…65 永遠除不盡。\n2. **PF-0 直接排除子網格**\n   - S:226：「本版鋪排來源主格不得作 D19 子網格的父格，也不適用 D19a」。\n   - 在 PF-0 的鋪排流程裡，子網格完全用不上，跟整除無關。\n3. **來源子規則不支援面材排法**\n   - D19a / I25a（M:724）不支援 REPEAT_PANEL。\n   - 手動子格是一個父格一份（M:262）；全 World 主格加子格上限 16 組（M:622）。所以就算能整除，每個板格各建一份也不可行：一間 3.6 × 5 m 的房間就要 12–15 份。\n4. **重複開間不收子格線**\n   - D58（S:786）：「D19 子格線、D19a 來源規則線及其他引用不在本能力內」。\n   - 副支線只能是 D6 參考線或主格格線。\n\n## 現在唯一的路徑\n\n手動畫 D6 參考線：每排板在 1830 方向畫 4 條，寫成「格線 + 有理係數 × 尺寸」。不含參數的舊式求值後取下界（M:74）。再用 D58 重複開間生成副支（S:548、S:778–795）。\n\n這條路可行，但每排板都要人手定 4 條線。而且較新的條文對非整數一律拒絕、不暗取整：\n\n- 含 D31 參數的 D6a 式子（M:75）\n- D6c（M:110）\n- D30（M:442）\n\n所以板尺寸改用參數卡時，這條路可能也會被擋。這一點我未實測，標為推論。\n\n## 已列為未定案\n\n§四（M:1170）已把 `support_step`、`by_span 條件等分` 列為「仍未定案，不得據此實作」。平釘天花現在需要的就是這一類機制。\n\n## 請求\n\n定案「依間距上限在一段跨度內放中間支撐」的機制。要求：\n\n- 能用在面材鋪排的格子上。\n- 整數 mm 規則要在定義裡明寫。D10a 處理奇數縫時說明過：「已知但需取整」不是猜，可以明定取下界。這與 I33「不暗取整」不衝突，因為規則是明示的。\n- 例：完整格 [1831, 3663] 分 5 段，精確值 2197.4、2563.8、2930.2、3296.6，取下界得 2197、2563、2930、3296。間距是 366 或 367，不累積。\n\n這也牽涉重議 #57 的整除保護。\n\n依使用者 2026-10-12 的產品方向（幾何公理是領域無關的核心，木工是第一個套用的模板）：\n\n- 核心：只需要「跨度 + 間距上限 → 整數位置」這類通用原語。\n- 木工模板：上限值、「每片 4 支」、哪些線放副支。\n\n## 狀態\n\n`公理層.md` 是 SSOT。本 issue 只回報、建議方向，未改條文；是否修改、怎麼改由使用者拍板。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/203/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54","id":5687471478,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUv_tdg","number":54,"title":"[功能提案] 從 PDF／圖片底圖快速取得房間輪廓，減少手動臨摹","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12244016589,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAAC2czdzQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-03T07:10:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"使用者於 2026-10-03 匯入平面圖底圖後提出需求：\n\n> 我匯入了底圖，如果我想要重建平面投影的幾何，要怎麼辦？如果我只想要房間輪廓，我還要花費非常多精力臨摹底圖的幾何嗎？\n\n## 問題與目前行為\n\n目前 PDF／圖片匯入提供來源保存、選頁、兩點尺寸校準及人工描外環；匯入不會產生房間幾何。使用者即使只需要某個房間的室內淨輪廓，仍須辨別牆線、逐點描繪轉角並核對尺寸。\n\n圖上同時有牆體、門扇、文字、尺寸線及天花分格等資訊，使用者不需要重建全部內容。目標是降低「取得所需房間輪廓」的操作成本，接續既有平面投影及空間建模流程。\n\n另有狀態誤導：目前「✓ 描外環」依面是否已有頂點判斷。新面既有的矩形即可觸發勾選，不能證明已完成底圖房間的重建。校準底圖不會自動縮放已有面幾何。\n\n## 預期流程（待設計與技術評估）\n\n1. 沿用現有底圖匯入、選頁與校準。\n2. 使用者點選或框選想重建的房間範圍。\n3. 應用提出室內淨輪廓候選，疊到底圖供核對；排除不需要的文字、尺寸線、門扇弧線及分格。\n4. 使用者修正漏邊、凹口或錯誤連接，核對關鍵尺寸，再確認建立正式面。\n5. 保存 `.gcanvas` 後能重新開啟、對照來源，並使用既有平面投影／空間建模功能。\n\n自動或半自動方式均可評估；不預先指定辨識演算法，不要求一次完整還原全屋或所有構件。矩形、L 形及有局部凹口的正交房間可作為首批評估案例。\n\n## 範圍與契約\n\n- 辨識結果先是可編輯候選；人工確認後仍走既有核心驗證、影響確認與復原流程，不直接覆寫已確認幾何。\n- 明確區分室內淨輪廓、牆中心線及牆外輪廓；含糊處需要使用者核對，不自行猜定。\n- 校準量取、圖上標註尺寸與正式幾何入值須分辨；不可將影像辨識宣稱為精確量測。\n- 沿用公理 D1／D3／I2 的整數 mm 與正交輪廓限制；斜牆、弧牆或不閉合／自交候選須提示，不能偷偷正交化或放寬條文。\n- 保留手動描繪及尺寸輸入作為修正與備援。\n- 本 issue 是需求立案；辨識方式、候選資料契約與實作範圍仍待定案，不代表已授權修改公理。\n\n## UI 減重方向\n\n沿用「底圖 → 描外環」既有流程容納候選取得與修正，合併重複的描繪說明，避免另建獨立工作區或一組常駐入口。實作前依 GEO-219 在 BACKLOG 記明實際移除／合併的項目。\n\n## 驗收方向\n\n- [ ] 校準後只選目標房間即可取得可核對的輪廓候選，無須先臨摹整張底圖。\n- [ ] 候選支援疊圖、修正與尺寸核對；辨識不完整時明示缺口，不誤報完成。\n- [ ] 確認前原面不變；取消、失敗及不合法幾何保留原場景，確認後可復原／重做。\n- [ ] 矩形、L 形、凹口案例使用非機密夾具驗證；記錄操作次數或時間，與現行人工描繪比較。\n- [ ] 保存重開後輪廓、來源頁與校準對位一致，能接續既有平面投影流程。\n- [ ] 「描外環」進度能區分原有矩形與本次已完成／已核對的重建，不因存在任意頂點就宣稱成功。\n\n## 相關工作\n\n- GEO-198：既有 PDF／圖片來源保存、校準與人工描面；`geometry-web/docs/REFERENCE-RECONSTRUCTION-PLAN.md` 提及自動辨識可作候選幾何入口。\n- #48：圖面—模型證據關聯，著重人工證據連結；本 issue 著重取得輪廓並減少人工臨摹，可共用來源追溯能力。\n- `geometry-web/docs/FACE-PROJECTION.md`：正式面的投影用途與室內淨範圍解讀。\n\n本 issue 以文字記錄需求，不附私人原圖或含私人圖面的截圖；驗收資料另用非機密夾具。\n\n---\n\n## Agent 開發任務補充（2026-10-03）\n\n使用者後續要求：「我想要讓 agent 去解決這個問題，進行開發。」本段將上述需求推進為實作任務，保留原需求與驗收條件；授權範圍是 #54 的功能開發、測試及 PR，不包含修改公理、合併 PR 或部署。\n\n### 任務目標與交付方式\n\n請在此儲存庫實際開發，不要只提供調研、計畫或獨立示範 HTML。完成既有 geometry-web 中「校準底圖 → 選目標房間 → 取得候選 → 修正／核對 → 確認建立正式面 → 保存重開」的可操作流程，提交功能分支與 PR，附測試及驗收證據。\n\n從執行當下最新預設分支建立隔離分支；先檢查相關進行中 PR，避免覆寫其他工作。不要直接推送預設分支，不要自動合併、關閉 issue 或部署。可拆分提交／PR，但只有部分完成時必須逐條列明剩餘缺口，不能把狀態修正或單一向量案例當作整張 issue 已完成。\n\n### 開工前閱讀與基線\n\n1. 讀取根目錄及實際修改路徑適用的 `AGENTS.md`，依其要求閱讀 `geometry-guide/PRODUCT-VISION.md`、`公理層.md`；願景不是額外實作授權，公理仍是 SSOT。\n2. 讀取 `BACKLOG.md` 的 GEO-198／GEO-219，以及 `geometry-web/docs/REFERENCE-RECONSTRUCTION-PLAN.md`、`geometry-web/docs/REFERENCE-PROJECT.md`、`geometry-web/docs/FACE-PROJECTION.md`、`geometry-web/docs/DOM-CONTRACT.md`。以執行時最新程式及契約為準，不照搬舊文件中的格式版本或測試數量。\n3. 依 `AGENTS.md` 檢查 feedback 收件匣；雲端沒有本機 feedback 或私人 PDF 時如實記錄，不要求使用者重新上傳才開始。\n4. 在隔離環境跑現有相關測試，記錄基準 commit、命令及結果。在 BACKLOG 先記錄本次範圍、候選資料契約和實際要合併／移除的重複 UI，再進行實作。符合現有公理的技術細節由 agent 評估、記錄並實作；真正需要變更公理或超出本 issue 範圍的部分另列阻塞，不自行放寬。\n\n### 實作順序\n\n**A. 先修復完成狀態的誤導。**\n\n「已有面頂點」不等於「已依此來源重建並核對」。讓原有矩形、待核對候選、已確認輪廓及需要重新核對可被正確區分；以實際來源、來源頁、校準與幾何關聯判定。更換來源／頁面、重新校準或相關幾何變更時，按實際影響使舊候選失效或要求重新核對。不能只把完成文案藏掉。\n\n底圖校準與正式幾何尺寸分開處理。重新校準不靜默縮放或覆寫已確認面；介面須清楚說明受影響的對象。不要為了讓畫面看似對齊就擅改正式幾何。\n\n**B. 評估並實作可用來源的候選取得。**\n\n優先檢查目標區域是否有可利用的 PDF 向量繪圖資料；可用時優先重用原始路徑／線段，不預設先點陣化。先核對儲存庫實際 vendor PDF.js 版本與可用 API。向量存在不等於具有牆或房間的語意，不得把所有閉合路徑都當室內淨輪廓。\n\n只有掃描影像／圖片或向量不足時，提供本地影像輔助的半自動候選取得與手動修正。依非機密夾具評估具體演算法與適用限制；不承諾任意圖面的一鍵全自動辨識。只有手動描繪備援、不具備影像輔助取得候選時，不得宣稱圖片路徑已完成。\n\n先讓使用者點選或框選目標區域，再提出候選。排除文字、尺寸線、門扇弧及分格等干擾；門洞缺口、相鄰房間連通或多個可能輪廓等歧義須提示並讓使用者核對，不能默默補牆、吞掉凹口或把框選矩形冒充房間。\n\n明確區分 PDF 頁面／裁切與旋轉、顯示 viewport、底圖變換、校準比例與面局部座標。用測試證明縮放／取景／移動／直角旋轉後候選仍對位，不能依螢幕像素直接當 mm。\n\n**C. 把候選修正、確認及保存接入既有流程。**\n\n候選只放在可編輯草稿／預覽狀態，不成為第二份權威幾何。定義並測試最小資料契約：來源身分及頁碼、校準／變換依據、取得方式、候選輪廓、歧義／警告，以及確認結果與既有面之關聯。草稿是否跨次保存須明確定義；已確認輪廓與來源對位必須保存。\n\n支援疊圖核對、局部補邊／修正、關鍵尺寸輸入與確認／取消，沿用既有輪廓編輯能力，避免重造工作區。PDF 向量座標、校準推估尺寸、圖上標註尺寸及使用者確認入值須分辨；正式提交仍須滿足整數 mm 與正交限制，數值修整及偏差要可見，不偷偷把斜牆改直角。\n\n确认前不改原面。确认時走既有核心驗證、影響確認與原子提交；失敗／取消不留半成品，成功可完整復原／重做。保存格式如需擴充，沿用最新 `.gcanvas` 版本及引用驗證機制，不改壞舊專案，也不讓舊讀取器靜默丟資料。\n\n### 必須有的驗收證據\n\n- 使用可公開的自製夾具，覆蓋矩形、L 形、局部凹口；分別驗證向量 PDF 與影像來源，並包含文字／尺寸線／門扇干擾與相鄰房間／缺口情境。\n- 檢查凹口及連通關係，不只比外接框、面積或頂點數。不得硬編碼夾具座標、為測試圖特判，或將 L 形簡化為矩形。\n- 候選疊圖、修正、確認／取消、核心拒絕、影響確認取消、復原／重做，均以操作及狀態斷言驗證；生成失敗、未校準或資料不合法要明示，不誤報完成。\n- 保存 → 關閉／重新載入 → 對照來源頁與校準 → 繼續平面投影／既有空間建模，驗證完整流程；另測來源替換、重新校準與舊專案相容性。不能憑空補猜牆高或厚度來證明輪廓正確。\n- 桌面與窄螢幕實際操作新增 UI，保留手動描繪、無限畫布、構件流程及既有 DOM 契約。修改 `app.js` 時依 repo 規定跑完整 `cdp_test.js` 及受影響測試；測試在隔離服務和暫存資料上執行，不操作使用者正在使用的場景。\n- 同一組夾具、相同起點與相同核對終點，實測新流程相對人工描繪的操作次數或時間；把修正及尺寸核對成本納入，報告改善和失敗案例，不用估算冒充量測。\n- 辨識及測試不得把私人圖面上傳外部服務，不擅自引入付費 API；公開提交、截圖和 CI artifacts 均用非機密夾具。\n\n### PR 應包含\n\n1. 使用者實際操作入口與步驟、改前／改後畫面（非機密夾具）。\n2. 具體實作方法、候選／來源資料契約、格式相容性及已知限制。\n3. 每項原始驗收條件對應的程式／測試位置、實際命令與結果、基準及交付 commit、可核對的 CI 連結。\n4. 人工描繪與新流程的實測比較，以及尚未完成／未能驗證的項目。\n\n最終請提供可檢視的 PR 與證據，不只回覆「已完成」。若執行環境有阻塞，完成可獨立驗證的部分並交付草稿 PR，精確列明阻塞；不可將未執行測試寫成通過。\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\n自動辨識A→B→C：此單A先修單房實際失敗，保持已合併候選/snap/性能接口；B另#87同頁多候選；C#77独立Boundary/共享基準。REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗，不重複索取、不以合成pass代替。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/54/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322","id":5940714158,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYhgarg","number":322,"title":"GEO-261 follow-up: column/beam snapshot without faces raises unclassified KeyError","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T11:18:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:18:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"GEO-261 後續(既有問題，不擋 #288)。\n\n**現象**:public `modeling.engine.evaluate` 路徑上，如果 legacySnapshot 裡 column/beam 的 solid 沒有 `faces` 欄位,W `geometry-templates/woodworking/geometry_woodworking/model_sources.py` 約第 76 行的 `solid[\"faces\"]` 會丟出未分類的 `KeyError: 'faces'`,沒有轉成 `ModelError`。原因是 `model_runtime.py:134-142` 只把帶 `clause` 的 ValueError 轉成 ModelError。\n\n**範圍**\n- timber 缺 `faces` 時，會先被 H 的 `_require_native_box_faces` 以 BASE_SOURCE_BINDING 擋下，所以只有 column/beam 會崩。\n- `require_snapshot` 與 `_snapshot_root_associations` 都只檢查 kind 和 id。\n- 真的 C adapter 輸出一定帶 `faces`。只有 adapter 輸出格式壞掉時才會觸發。\n\n**修法(預估一行)**:改用 `.get` 並檢查型別，失敗時呼叫 `_fail`,以既有的 BASE_SOURCE_BINDING/I32 拒絕。另補一個 public 路徑的負測，斷言 (status, code, clause, message),並做突變自證。\n\n**來源**:opus 對抗審查 `architecture/geo261-rootcat-20261020` @ `6300d887`(F2)。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/322/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300","id":5905200127,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABX_oz_w","number":300,"title":"Raise the timber capacity (64) so a real room's framing fits; unify the five GEO-261 capacity constants","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-18T01:59:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T09:27:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**問題**:核心一個 World 最多 64 支角材(`WORLD_MAX_TIMBERS`)。下角材核心探針(#297)實跑時,F1 客廳要 108–116 支，第 65 支起全被拒(362 支);五房整套要 266–310 支。條文沒有規定這個數字(I33 只規定容量不足要回 CAPACITY),它是純實作常數，出處是 `決策佇列.md` B-15(暫定)。\n\n**調查**(全文:本機 `D:/geometry-axiom-work/core-probe-c2d218c2/capacity-analysis.md`):\n- main 只要改一行(`current_geometry.c` 的 `WORLD_MAX_TIMBERS`)。GEO-261 整合分支有五處各自寫死 64,而且互相沒有綁定:`WORLD_MAX_TIMBERS`、`WOOD_MEMBER_CAPACITY`、`WOOD_CONTACT_MEMBER_CAPACITY`、`WOOD_CUT_LIST_MEMBER_CAPACITY`、`WOOD_MEMBER_SPAN_MEMBER_CAPACITY`。只改其中一個會越界，而且照樣編得過。\n- 記憶體：每支角材槽 1888 bytes。放大到 512 時，每個 World 增加約 18–21%,約 70 份 World 合計多 56.5 MiB。\n- `print_cut_list` 有一個隨 N 平方成長的堆疊陣列，放大前要先修。\n- 其他上限：參考線 16(最差排法剛好用滿)、空間 4(五房就超過)。\n- **時間比記憶體更早碰壁**:依前綴重放擬合，五房整套一次載入約 22–27 秒，接近 bridge 30 秒逾時。這要另外處理(增量驗證或分批提交),不是靠加大常數。\n\n**決定(Claude 代決，可推翻)**:\n- 放大到 512。單房最大 116 支，有 4.4 倍餘裕;五房整套 310 支，有 1.65 倍。\n- **只在 GEO-261 合入後的 main 上做一次**,避免和檔案搬移衝突。\n- 把五個常數收斂成單一來源，以模板的 `WOOD_MEMBER_CAPACITY` 為準，並加上 `_Static_assert`。\n- 一併做：修 `print_cut_list` 的平方陣列;補「第 N 支接受、第 N+1 支拒絕」的邊界測試(附突變);重跑突變帳本;同步 `ARCHITECTURE.md` 等說明。\n- 放大後重跑 #297 探針，查那 362 支有沒有新的規則拒絕。\n- 參考線、空間上限與載入時間另開單。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320","id":5935465920,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYcgFwA","number":320,"title":"Web app: recovering the connection leaves the old connection.error, which later blocked edits echo","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T03:36:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T03:36:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# 連線恢復後沒有清除 `connection.error`，舊錯誤訊息一直留著\n\n（草稿，2026-10-20。來源：分析 GEO-261 整合分支 `09ab5f79` 的 canvas job 時發現；這次不修。）\n\n## 現象\n\n`recoverConnection()` 成功恢復後，把 `connection.phase` 設回 `\"ready\"`，但 `connection.error` 仍保留上一次失敗的字串。\n\n在 `09ab5f79` 的 canvas job 裡，P72B 失敗時 `FATAL_UI` 印出：\n\n```\n\"connection\":{\"phase\":\"ready\",\"error\":\"無法確認載入結果，已暫停編輯。請確認服務後重試。\"}\n```\n\n這句錯誤是約 20 分鐘前 P61-10／P61-11 刻意注入 `/upload/confirm` 失敗時留下的。兩條斷言當時都通過（job.log 第 912-913 行）；從 P53 的 reload（job.log 第 845 行）之後就沒有任何頁面導覽，所以字串一路留到 P72B。它與 P72B 的失敗無關，卻讓診斷者誤以為載入確認逾時了。\n\n## 程式位置（`geometry-web/app.js`，整合分支 `09ab5f79`）\n\n- `:492`：初始值是 `connection = { phase: \"loading\", known: false, error: \"\", recovering: false }`。\n- `:564-567` `connectionFailed(message)`：設 `phase = \"error\"`、`error = message`。\n- `:568-603` `recoverConnection()`：`:570` 設 `phase = \"loading\"`；`:593` 設 `phase = \"ready\"; connection.known = true;`，**沒有清 `error`**。\n- `:625` `apiRequest()`：phase 是 `\"loading\"` 時會擋下修改類指令，回傳 `error: connection.error || \"場景尚未讀取完成\"`。\n\n錯誤來源之一是 `geometry-web/reference-workspace.js:1990-1991`：`uploadScene()` 的 `/upload` 或 `/upload/confirm` 拋錯（逾時、HTTP 非 ok、回應不是 JSON）時呼叫 `connectionFailed(\"無法確認載入結果，已暫停編輯。請確認服務後重試。\")`。\n\n## 影響\n\n1. **使用者看得到（輕微）**：下一次重試期間 phase 是 `\"loading\"`，此時送出的修改指令會從 `:625` 拿到上一次的舊錯誤（例如「無法確認載入結果…」），而不是「場景尚未讀取完成」。\n2. **診斷誤導**：測試框架的 `FATAL_UI` 和 `cdp_test.js:3603` 的 `Missing control` 診斷都會印出 `connection.error`。phase 已經是 ready 時，這個欄位看起來像目前的錯誤。\n3. `showConnectionState()`（`:547-563`）只在 `phase === \"error\"` 時顯示 `error`，所以畫面上的連線提示本身不受影響。\n\n## 建議修法（未實作）\n\n在 `app.js:593` 轉為 ready 時一併清掉：\n\n```js\nconnection.phase = \"ready\"; connection.known = true; connection.error = \"\";\n```\n\n另外檢查其他把 phase 設回 `\"ready\"` 的地方（例如首次載入路徑）有沒有同樣的問題，一併處理。\n\n## 驗收\n\n- 在 P61-10 與 P61-11（`cdp_test.js:6606-6616`）`await recoverConnection()` 之後的斷言加上 `connection.error === \"\"`。\n- 在 P53 重試恢復（`cdp_test.js:6360-6363`）之後也加同一條。\n- 突變控制：拿掉 `connection.error = \"\"` 時，這幾條必須轉紅，失敗訊息要能指出殘留的舊字串。\n- 斷言數會增加，`cdp_sections.golden.json` 對應段（P53、P57）必須用 `GEOMETRY_CDP_UPDATE_GOLDEN=1` 在完整模式零失敗下更新。\n\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/320/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319","id":5927545546,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYU8qyg","number":319,"title":"Framing oracle: C3 bearing band is clipped at region x-blocks when boards run along Y","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-19T16:24:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:24:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**來源**:下角材 oracle 第 21 輪(`3d858c31`)。為了給板長沿 Y 的 P-182 加對照組，作者造了一間新房 H6,在 H6 上發現這個問題。\n\n**現象**:板長沿 Y 時,C3 的承接帶會被房間的分塊截斷。\n- `Region.rects()` 只在頂點的 x 座標切塊，結果 C3 量承接帶時只看帶子所在的那一塊。\n- 縫離 x 分塊邊界不到 8 mm 時，就只量到縫所在的那一塊，另一塊的承接被漏掉。\n\n**證據**:突變 BC_no_doubling_cand(候選不放併料)\n- 套在 H6 的板長沿 X:C3 轉紅;\n- 套在 H6 的轉置版(板長沿 Y):C3 全過，候選照樣被選中。\n\n所以轉置版的併料現在是用 `TR182_DBL` 手寫範圍直接釘住，沒有靠 `check()`。\n\n**影響範圍**:目前只用 H6 證實。其他房型有沒有缺陷被它藏住，還沒掃過。\n\n**要做**:\n- 修 C3,讓承接帶跨分塊量測;\n- 加對照組，讓 BC_no_doubling_cand 在轉置版也被 C3 抓到;\n- 掃一遍現有的轉置族，確認沒有被藏住的缺陷。\n\noracle 分支:`feat/framing-oracle-20261015`(PR #251)。證據在本機 `D:/geometry-axiom-work/framing-oracle-gaps/round21/`。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/319/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308","id":5907824738,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABYCJAYg","number":308,"title":"Framing oracle: shallow pilasters (29–53 mm) and mid-room wall steps reported unbuildable without a reason","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-18T08:50:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:50:25Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"opus 審查(#251 `98cb7da0`)發現:\n- 4100×3700 房、壁柱 x 1500–1900、深 29–53 mm,四種「板長沿 Y」排法全報 `SPAN_PARTLY_RC`,而且沒附理由;側牆版本也一樣，共 312 次。物理上，那條 13 mm 帶子夾在延伸段與牆邊料之間，依 R-nosliver 應算兩側承接，可施工。\n- 牆階在房間中段的房型：不可施工的原因裡,`MAIN_HITS_RC_TIMBER` 30 次、`SHORT_FACE_SEAM_EDGE_UNSUPPORTED` 160 次。抽查顯示有些應判為核心限制，或其實可以調整。\n\n依使用者 2026-10-15 原話(副支位置可以調整，在間距上限以下就好)推得的原則：能調整就調整，找不到調整位置才報衝突，並附物理理由。這些情況要逐類修正或附理由。\n\n審查工具在本機 scratchpad 的 `tools/`(cover.py、g7.py)。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/308/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299","id":5905174372,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABX_nPZA","number":299,"title":"V_EXTENSION diagnostic does not name the locating edge and the exceeding interval (I22)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-18T01:55:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:55:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**現象**:`公理層.md` 的 I22 W 段(main `02baea2c` 約 1340–1351 行)要求：違反時拒絕(V_EXTENSION),**訊息指名料件、定位邊與超出的區間**。但核心目前的訊息(`current_geometry.c` 的 `timber_end_face_check`,約 7770 行)只有「V_EXTENSION:非 boundary 角材(N)的 footprint 超出定位邊範圍」,沒有指名是哪條定位邊、超出的區間是多少。\n\n**怎麼發現的**:#295 的 ChatGPT 審查(head `60c0f29`)須改第 2 項。p8、p8b 兩個場景只能驗訊息前綴，所以就算產品漏掉定位邊與區間，測試也會全綠。\n\n**修正要求**:\n- 訊息補上定位邊(邊的 id 或端點)與實際超出的區間(mm)。\n- p8(低端)、p8b(高端)兩個鏡像場景各自驗完整的必要欄位。\n- 附突變：拿掉任一欄位，對應場景要轉紅。\n\n**排程**:等 GEO-261(#288)合入 main 之後再修。GEO-261 改動了核心放置程式的結構，現在改 `current_geometry.c`,整合時還得再移植一次。#295 只釘前綴，並在正文註明這個依賴。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/299/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252","id":5860640179,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXVJFsw","number":252,"title":"平行工作窗口 2026-10-15 晚:雲端 Codex 並行進度","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":94,"created_at":"2026-10-15T05:26:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:43:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"使用者電腦關機期間,由 dot 在 Codex 額度重置後(約 15:40 台北)開多個雲端 Codex 任務並行。任務定義在 `ops/agent-board` 分支 `BOARD-cloud-codex.md` 的「★ 平行工作窗口(2026-10-15 晚,使用者電腦關機期間)」一節(指定任務 19–24)。\n\n| 任務 | 內容 | 分支/PR | 狀態 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 19 | GEO-262 卡片級引用寫入公理層(🔒 採納) | axiom/adopt-card-reference-20261015 | 待開始 |\n| 20 | GEO-262 核心實作,切片 A(疊在 #193 上) | feat/card-reference-core-20261015 | 待開始 |\n| 21 | #227 PF-H 收尾 | #227 | 進行中(C2) |\n| 22 | PF-3(#226,疊在 #227 上) | #226 | 待開始 |\n| 23 | 下角材 oracle 接進 native(疊在 #251 上) | test/framing-oracle-suite-20261015 | 待開始 |\n| 24 | 審查 #237 新 head `879ceee4` | #237 | 待開始 |\n\n規則:只開 draft PR,不合併;雲端 native 只是參考,正式 7 項等使用者開機後由本機列車跑。dot 每輪檢查後,在本 issue 更新狀態。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/252/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232","id":5842255427,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXDm-Qw","number":232,"title":"ChatGPT 研究工人:工作佇列與進度記錄","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":41,"created_at":"2026-10-14T05:03:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T18:21:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"這張 issue 只用來記錄 ChatGPT 研究工人(GPT-6 Pro)的進度。\n\n- 工作佇列與規則:`ops/agent-board` 分支上的 `BOARD-chatgpt-research.md`(由 Claude 維護)。\n- 研究工人每完成一項,在這裡留一則:「R編號 完成:<成果連結>」;做到一半時間到了,就留「R編號 進行中:做到哪裡、下一步是什麼」。\n- 開工前先看這裡最後幾則,接著做下一個還沒完成的項目。\n- 請求次數配額:2026-10-14 起約 2.5 天,總共不超過 150 次。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/232/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240","id":5850654947,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXLno4w","number":240,"title":"公理層一致性總檢(2026-10-14 多批採納後)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-10-14T15:31:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T16:43:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"【ChatGPT 研究】R9：全文一致性總檢——編號盤點、條文反例、白話偏差與術語定位缺口\n\n研究基準：main `79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21`，開工與交付前讀取一致。研究看板 blob `389055199153d4eb88d8e1dee5cdaf8143eca2f1`，承接 #232 第二批的 R9。以指定標題搜尋既有 issue，未命中重複項。\n\n通讀範圍為 [公理層.md:1](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1) 至 §四末尾，以及 [geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:1–8](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L1-L8) 至 R59 末段。兩檔 Git blob 分別為 `f7687f60195ba7d33d0f4c55f00096c4d0b7d815`、`775edfb032bde9aef33993db18beec42eabd3016`。透過 GitHub 分段讀取並回補截斷處，做文字與公式核對；沒有執行產品、閱讀器、原生、瀏覽器或 WSL 測試，沒有重跑或新增突變。以下反例是條文推導，不是實跑收據。\n\n## 一、結論與嚴重度\n\n共列九項。優先級表示對規格理解、幾何判定或驗收方向的影響，不是 PR 合併裁決，也不是九個已實跑的產品缺陷。\n\n| 編號 | 優先級／性質 | 結果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| S1 | 高／條文定義與通用結論不一致 | R18 的幾何 coversEdge 定義可得到主支為真，但同條又稱主支恆為假；凹口短外邊反例見下。 |\n| S2 | 中／確定的白話偏差 | 白話 D1 容許等分分配餘數，與正式及白話 I25/I25a 的禁止相反。 |\n| S3 | 中／確定的白話限定遺漏 | 白話 I10 把有限網格的 64 條／範圍限制泛化，漏掉無限主格的明文例外。 |\n| S4 | 中／白話過度概括 | 白話 R45 把所有凹角面說成整批不能建立；正式規則按明選集合驗證，沒有這個一概拒絕條件。 |\n| S5 | 中／白話超出條文可推出範圍 | 白話 I53 從零體積接觸推到「板可以直接釘在樑底」，超出幾何判定能證明的內容。 |\n| S6 | 中／可重算的語意疑點，需確認 | 雙軸 stagger 下，D30 的 cell 矩形和 D10b 的實際分段格線邊界對不上；不能未確認就當產品錯誤。 |\n| S7 | 低／術語歧義 | I5 的「不得相交」若包含貼齊，會與 at-face 等必要接觸衝突；若只指穿越則可相容。 |\n| S8 | 低／跨文件狀態標注不一致 | Q38 正式檔頭已說核心／介面合入，白話檔頭仍說尚未實作。 |\n| S9 | 低／D 定義定位缺口 | 回執／回執恢復承擔不重送與延續證明，但兩檔未提供其獨立 D 定義或明確的外部契約定位。 |\n\n本輪不附公理改寫、不選擇歧義中的新政策，也不以白話覆蓋 SSOT。以下把可以確定的文字差異與仍需確認的解讀分開。\n\n## 二、編號與懸空引用盤點\n\n按條目標題人工逐段盤點，而非把正文每次提到的條號重算成一個定義：\n\n| 類別 | 正式條文的主序號 | 附字母條目 | 對應白話 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| D | D1–D63 | D6a、D6b、D6c、D10a、D10b、D19a | 均有對應區塊。 |\n| I | I1–I73 | I7a、I8a、I25a | 均有對應區塊。 |\n| R | R1–R59 | 無另列附字母條目 | 均有對應區塊。 |\n\n按此口徑為 D 69、I 76、R 59，共 204 個条目；兩份文件的條目集合對得上。本輪未發現同一條目重複定義、主序號缺號，亦未找到指向不存在 D/I/R 編號的具體實例。這是全文人工盤點結果，不宣稱已執行解析器或形式驗證。\n\nD12 提前在 D5 附近、D10b 放在 D29 後，以及白話把較晚採納的 D29/D31 等放在舊 R31 後，屬編排順序，不是缺號。`D46–R50`、`D59–R58` 是跨種類的範圍簡稱，不能把中間所有數字都當成同一種類的缺失條號。只有 D1 幾何限制並不禁止 D31 的精確有理數或 I33 計算用中點；沒有把這些明文分層報成矛盾。\n\n## 三、逐項結果\n\n### S1｜高：R18「主支 coversEdge 恆假」不是其幾何定義的通用推論\n\n**位置：**[公理層.md:1545–1551](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1545-L1551)、[公理層.md:1552–1564](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1552-L1564)、[公理層.md:968–995](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L968-L995)。白話僅列幾何判式：[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:602–612](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L602-L612)。\n\nR18 先明定屬性純由幾何推導、不看角色或錨法：側面與某條外邊共線且正長度重疊為 onBoundary；長度區間再包含那條邊即 coversEdge。後面卻稱 primary 的 coversEdge 恆為假，理由是兩端被 boundary 佔掉料寬。\n\n**反例（全部數字為 mm，未實跑）：**普通承載面取整數正交框架，無孔，外環依序為\n`(0,0),(1000,0),(1000,1000),(0,1000),(0,700),(100,700),(100,300),(0,300)`，全部 FIXED。\n\n先有兩支沿 u 的 boundary，足跡分別為 `[0,1000]×[0,27]`、`[0,1000]×[973,1000]`。再考慮沿 +v、寬 27 的 primary：以合法 D6 引用線 u=113 定位（例如引用已宣告的 D6b 具名 113），其足跡為 `[100,127]×[27,973]`；三支截面高可同為 33。\n\n這支料的兩端頂 boundary 的側面，優先級 1<2；足跡包含在有效區域，與前兩支只接觸、不正面積重疊；主支軸 v 一致。凹口外邊 e5 是 u=100、v∈[300,700]。料的側面與它共線，且 `[27,973]` 完整包含 `[300,700]`，因此照 R18 前半段判式，onBoundary=true、coversEdge=true。主支兩端雖已被邊界材裁短，仍可能比這條凹口短外邊更長。R19(b) 也明說不是每條外邊都必須先有 boundary，不能用「凹口兩個端點必然另有邊界材」排除本例。\n\n**確定範圍：**前述幾何定義與「恆假」的通用推論不能同時给出相同值。若把「恆假」另當新增放置限制，則會拒絕這種幾何；那與「純幾何推導出的必然結果」是不同解讀。本輪不據此強行要求核心接受該場景，更不宣稱整份公理無模型或產品已重現缺陷。這個反例回報的是 R18 的定義／結論界線。後續要驗產品，必須讀回同一足跡、角色及三個屬性，而不是只檢查放置有無報錯。\n\n### S2｜中：白話 D1 的「1000 分三份」違反精確等分規則\n\n**位置：**[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:35–38](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L35-L38)、[公理層.md:1040–1058](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1040-L1058)、[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:417–434](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L417-L434)。\n\n白話 D1 說既有等分仍可把 1000 分成 334/333/333。正式 I25 要求跨度能被等分數整除，明禁四捨五入、截斷及分配餘數；I25a 也沿用精確等分。白話自己的 I25/I25a 同樣禁止分配餘數。\n\n具體輸入為合法 D19 父格某軸跨度 1000、n=3：1000 mod 3=1，正式結果應拒絕，不能以 334/333/333 接受。本輪沒有找到支持這個「既有等分」例外的正式條文。D10a 最後留裁切板片、或其他模板以具名規格展開不等距記號，都不是 D19 等分可分配餘數的授權。這是直接影響接受／拒絕預期的白話偏差，不是單純少講細節。\n\n### S3｜中：白話 I10 未保留有限／無限主格的限制分界\n\n**位置：**[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:330–336](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L330-L336)、[公理層.md:936–955](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L936-L955)、[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:705–710](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L705-L710)。\n\n白話 I10 泛稱每條座標都在承載面外接範圍、每組每軸最多 64 條線。正式 I10 已明分：64 條屬有限來源及子格；無限主格不展開保存全部線，每次查詢容量依 I37，from-binding 無限主格不受全部來源線須在範圍內的限制。白話 I37 自己也有正確說明。\n\n例如 step=10 的無限來源配置到寬 2000 的面，可見範圍可能有超過 64 條線；這不使來源或配置失效。一次 exact 查詢超過容量才回容量不足，sample 必明示不完整。白話 I10 的絕對句會把「查詢輸出過量」讀成「World 定義非法」，也會把面外仍存在的 signed 索引讀成非法。不是主張放寬有限網格的原限制。\n\n### S4｜中：白話 R45 的「有凹角就整批交不出去」不是正式通用條件\n\n**位置：**[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:886–887](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L886-L887)、[公理層.md:1758–1773](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1758-L1773)、[公理層.md:1552–1564](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1552-L1564)。\n\n白話末句把貼牆柱、角柱及 L 形等凹角面概括為整批無法提交。正式 R45 則逐項列候選與違規，使用者明選一組後，在 fresh 候選中驗該集合；其拒絕條件是集合內有違規，不是輪廓有凹角。\n\n**最小規格反例，未實跑：**沿用 S1 的凹口輪廓，但不放 S1 那支待檢 primary。令完成面／試排、板厚及角材高度均合法且無障礙，明選主支軸 v。R45(3) 可列出頂邊 e0 的 boundary 候選；只明選這一支，其足跡 `[0,1000]×[0,27]` 整條覆蓋 e0，兩端頂 FIXED 外邊符合 boundary 的規則。R19(b) 明說施工中不要求每條外邊都已有邊界材。這個明選集合沒有因凹口本身而必然違規。\n\n反例只針對「該面一概不能建立候選集合」的說法；不是宣稱全部候選全選、整面骨架或任何特定凹角處理都已通過。把部分凹角配置的失敗擴寫成全類型拒絕，會錯誤擴大 R45 的規格拒絕範圍。\n\n### S5｜中：白話 I53 把幾何接觸轉成了施工可行敘述\n\n**位置：**[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:859–860](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L859-L860)、[公理層.md:1709–1717](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1709-L1717)、[公理層.md:1743–1749](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1743-L1749)、[公理層.md:1920–1930](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1920-L1930)。\n\n白話在「只是貼著不算撞」之後加了「板可以直接釘在樑底」。R41/I53 的開區間判定只確定該層沒有正體積交疊；R43 明示幾何承接不證明釘距、載重、跨距或固定強度，§四也排除固定件、與樓板連接等施工判定。\n\n因此這個施工敘述不能由所引用的幾何判定推出。這不是本輪判定任何實際做法必然可行或不可行，也不是反對已採納的零體積接觸政策；只回報白話把「通過這一項幾何判定」延伸成了另一種承諾。\n\n### S6｜中、需確認：雙軸 stagger 的 cell 矩形與分段格線不一致\n\n**位置：**[公理層.md:452–462](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L452-L462)、[公理層.md:473–489](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L473-L489)、[公理層.md:491–503](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L491-L503)、[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:628–631](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L628-L631)。\n\nD10b 容許兩軸各自 stagger，又說 band 用另一軸未錯開格線切段，並據此稱 cell 仍為矩形；D30 則在 cell 內點的兩個座標各加相應 shift。\n\n**可直接重算的輸入：**u/v 都為 REPEAT，phase=0、step=100、δ=50。兩軸 δ 均非零、非間距整數倍。\n\n依 D30，cell(1,0) 的四角範圍為 `[100,200]×[50,150]`；cell(0,1) 為 `[50,150]×[100,200]`，兩矩形重疊 `[100,150]×[100,150]`。\n\n再看第一個 cell 的右邊：其 u=200、v∈[50,150]。依 D10b，u 索引 2 在 band 0 只於 v∈[0,100] 維持 u=200；到 v∈[100,200] 的 band 1，該線段已在 u=250。所以矩形右邊上 `(200,120)` 並不在該條實際輸出的垂直格線段上。不是只差一個端點或取整問題。\n\n**確定與未確定分開：**上述數值差異由兩份明寫公式推出；但目前沒有明文說雙軸 stagger 的 cell 是否故意是可重疊、且不必由顯示線段完整圍住的「邏輯矩形」。若是這種意思，不能再把它和實際線段圍出的格子混稱；若不是，兩種幾何結果無法直接對齊。本輪列為語意需確認，不自行禁止雙軸 stagger、不選新的 cell 政策。\n\n**推測：**實作中的 cell 命中／錨點與線段繪製可能呈現不同格子。驗證方式是對上列同一來源同時取得原生 cell 四角、各 `(axis,k,band)` 線段及邊界點命中结果，保留未配置與配置後對照。尚未執行，不計產品缺陷已重現。\n\n### S7｜低：I5 的「相交」在必要接觸處有兩種讀法\n\n**位置：**[公理層.md:879–882](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L879-L882)、[公理層.md:956–969](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L956-L969)、[公理層.md:978–988](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L978-L988)、[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:293–296](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L293-L296)。\n\nI5 主句是 A0 矩形包含於有效範圍、不跨孔；括號又說四邊不得與輪廓／孔邊相交。若「相交」按集合交集非空解讀，貼齊或共線也被禁止；但 I13 at-face 必須貼齊，I20 的邊界材及 I19/R19 端面規則又需要這些接觸。例如正方形內頂邊 boundary 的長側面與外輪廓重合。\n\n若這裡只指「穿越邊界而造成部分 footprint 在外」，則能與其他條文相容。故本項是用詞／邊界判斷的歧義，不是本輪證明所有貼邊放材都非法。也不能把「不改用兩角點捷徑」解讀成改回近似包含檢查。\n\n### S8｜低：Q38 的現況橫幅沒有跨文件對齊\n\n**位置：**[公理層.md:27–29](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L27-L29)、[geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md:14–15](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/geometry-guide/公理層-白話.md#L14-L15)。\n\n正式檔頭已說 Q38 的 C 核心、建模執行器與介面隨 #167/#169 合入，完整同源瀏覽器驗收另列；白話同一 Q38 橫幅仍說尚未實作於現行 C 核心或物件畫布。兩份現行文件對實作狀態的表達不一致。\n\n這些橫幅帶歷史日期，不能僅憑它們推定今天所有驗收已完成；本項也不拿條文檔頭替代 PR/產品收據。缺口是讀者看到的現況／歷史標注未對齊，不是重新裁定 Q38 功能已完整支援。\n\n### S9｜低：回執／回執恢復缺少可定位的 D 定義錨點\n\n**位置：**[公理層.md:1326–1332](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1326-L1332)、[公理層.md:1362–1368](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1362-L1368)、[公理層.md:1823–1828](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1823-L1828)。\n\nI64 要求回覆遺失時沿既有回執恢復、不重送；I67 要求結果未知時以回執為準；R52 又要求回執能證明 World 與附件只發生特定增量，才延續候選工作。但 D1–D63 沒有回執／回執恢復的獨立定義；這些位置也沒有指向具體外部契約檔案，讓讀者辨認它是原生確認回覆、整筆專案交易紀錄，或另外保存的恢復證據。\n\n本項是「重要名詞的規範定位不足」，不宣稱現有程式沒有回執，也不要求每個工程用詞都新增一條 D。R52 已給一部分結果條件，但尚不能只靠這兩檔核對其發行者、與候選/context 的綁定、可重取範圍及配對失敗處理的完整來源。後續須以既有契約定位核對，不據本研究自行增加新的回執格式或交易政策。\n\n相對地，ParameterRef 在 D28/D31 有欄位定義；context、project revision、history frame 在 D51 有說明；歷史群組在 D60/R56 有提交與復原語意；onBoundary/coversEdge 在 R18 有判式。沒有把它們「未各佔一個新 D 標題」一律當成完全未定義。\n\n## 四、明文分界與未列為錯誤的項目\n\n這些是通讀時核對後排除的表面衝突：\n\n- D54 尚未列入的 PF／裁切身分，正文已明說未補列前不匯入；不是意外漏掉後卻默默允許。參見 [公理層.md:735–759](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L735-L759)。\n- D49 可描述模型快照計量世界，但 I59(a) 與 §四明确限制首版只支援目前 World；概念定義不等於首版已支援所有變體。[公理層.md:1260–1272](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1260-L1272)、[公理層.md:1968–1973](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1968-L1973)。\n- D43 的板列與 D29 cell 奇偶相反已有 I57/R44 的明示換算；不能把 snapshot 的 `anchor+δ`、`−δ` 當成無故換號。[公理層.md:1750–1757](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1750-L1757)。\n- R40 的 World 即時重算和 D63/R59 的已保存模型快照已明確分開，不因同 id 就混成矛盾。[公理層.md:1905–1916](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1905-L1916)。\n- 身分帳失敗不消耗本筆預留序號，與群組先前成功步驟的號碼不歸還已有 R56 的明文分界。[公理層.md:1873–1888](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L1873-L1888)。\n- 白話把新料支數稱需購入支數，在 D47 本身就有相同明文，不能報成白話自行添加；它不等於完整採購／庫存流程已被納入。[公理層.md:665–674](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/79412a858f712981fa0ba15a6b293c3e0bf06f21/公理層.md#L665-L674)。\n\n## 五、完成範圍與最不確定處\n\nR9 的交付為：兩檔全文通讀、條目集合盤點、懸空引用掃讀、九項依優先級排列的具體結果，以及已排除的表面衝突。未发现編號問題不代表已形式證明所有條文相容。\n\n**最大不確定性是 S6 的「cell」是否原本就打算表示不等同於實際格線圍成區域的邏輯矩形；其次是 S1 的『恆假』究竟被當作推論還是額外角色限制。** 兩項都保留完整數值和解讀界線，不把推測升格成已重現的產品缺陷。S7 的相交用語與 S9 的外部契約定位也明列需核對，不自行定義新規則。\n\n本輪未改任何 repository 檔案、SSOT、白話、正典、🔒、看板或 PR 狀態。研究完成不表示本 issue 的問題已解決，也不授權改寫條文。完成紀錄另留 #232；下一項為 R10 的 PF-2 合併後深度審查，本輪未開始。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/240/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249","id":5855983170,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXQs2Qg","number":249,"title":"[功能][公理] 網格系統直接引用整張參數卡(GEO-262)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-14T21:28:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T05:20:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 需求\n\n網格系統要能**直接引用整張參數卡**,把整張卡當作一個引用單位;不是像現在這樣,一個欄位挑一個參數欄位。\n\n## 使用者原話(🔒)\n\n  > 接下來我想確認一下 之前有排過 讓網格系統 能引用參數的功能嗎  如果沒有的話這是我想要加入的功能\n\n  （對話紀錄第 16667 行，台北 2026-10-15 05:18）\n\n  > 那為什麼我找不到可以 直接引用 (915,1830 ) 或者  915W1830H 的參數的功能?\n\n  （對話紀錄第 16734 行，台北 2026-10-15 05:21）\n\n  > 我並沒有看到可以直接引用這個參數卡的功能\n\n  （對話紀錄第 16766 行，台北 2026-10-15 05:24）\n\n協調 agent 列出兩種做法:A 是介面捷徑、不改公理;B 是整張卡當引用單位、要改公理。使用者所選:\n\n  > B 整張卡當引用單位\n\n  （對話紀錄第 16780 行，選項題回傳，台北 2026-10-15 05:26）\n\n## 現況\n\n- 已有逐欄引用:\n  - 無限網格(D29)的每個尺寸欄位可以「直接整數,或 D31 的 ParameterRef」(`公理層.md:485`)。\n  - 介面上每個欄位旁有「引用來源」選單(`geometry-web/parameters.js:37`)。\n  - 使用者已經用它把 u 的間距接到「參數.長」、v 的面材接到「參數.寬」。\n- 沒有卡片級引用:\n  - D31 規定引用是 `(parameterId, fieldId)`。\n  - D29 規定每個欄位恰有一個來源。\n- 所以要做 B,必須改公理(D29、D31,以及相關的 I、R、白話)。依規則,先寫公理差異提案,經對抗審查,使用者拍板後才實作。\n\n## 提案必須回答的問題\n\n1. **卡片級引用的定義**:引用保存的是什麼?\n   - 選項一:卡片身分,加上「哪個欄位對應網格哪個位置」。\n   - 選項二:卡片本身帶有「二維尺寸」之類的型別,網格引用該型別。\n   - 兩者對解耦(#248)的影響不同,要比較。\n2. **哪些卡可以被整張引用**:是否限定恰好兩個 dimension 欄位?多於兩欄或型別不符時怎麼處理?\n3. **對應到網格哪些欄位**:依各軸目前的模式,填「固定間距」的間距,或「面材+縫」的面材。其他欄位(第 0 線座標、縫寬、錨點、相位差)是否仍維持逐欄引用?\n4. **方向**:兩個長度分別給 u、v,以及兩軸對調,如何表示與保存。對調等於排板方向這個判斷點。\n5. **卡片變動時**:\n   - 改值:重算,格線身分不變,同現行。\n   - 刪欄位、改型別、增欄位:拒絕,還是另有規則?\n   - 刪卡:依 I38,屬於懸空引用。\n   - 改指到另一張卡:整組一起換。\n6. 與 D60(卡片刪除後同鍵重建是新存在期)、I8a 影響預覽、復原與重做、保存格式和舊檔相容的關係。\n7. **領域無關**:機制只能是「一組長度對應到網格的軸」這類幾何語意,不得寫進木工語意(對齊 #248)。\n8. 驗收案例與突變計畫:拿掉實作必須轉紅,而且失敗訊息指得出病因。\n\n## 排程\n\n| 階段 | 內容 | 負責 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 提案 | 公理差異提案:D29、D31 與相關 I、R、白話,逐條差異,回答上列問題 | Codex 雲端(指定任務 18) |\n| 2 審查 | 對抗審查 | Claude 派 opus |\n| 3 拍板 | 使用者看逐條差異後決定 | 使用者 |\n| 4 實作 | 核心與介面,走合併列車跑 7 項 | Codex |\n\n帳本工單:GEO-262。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/249/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209","id":5817794554,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWsR_-g","number":209,"title":"[測試穩定性] canvas P78 在慢機器上可能卡住:grid-trial-query 被前端中止後 igTrial 一直不 ready","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":29,"created_at":"2026-10-12T17:26:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T20:12:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 現象\n- #188 head 6855f9b1 的正式 canvas 首跑,在 P78「建立前矩形與角材試擺(不改世界)」中止。\n- 等待條件 `$('igTrial')?.dataset.trialState==='ready'` 超時。\n- 同時 connection.phase=error,錯誤訊息是 `The user aborted a request.`(grid-trial-query 被前端中止)。\n- 收據:wsl-ci/6855f9b1-proxy-188-main005,原件見 #188 留言 6126602394。\n\n## 已知\n- 同一段在 #197(2f2c900e)、#189(10f385d2)、#184(3835c43b)的 canvas 都通過。#188 同 head 單獨重跑也通過(2207/0、golden 84 段一致)。\n- 那一輪各 job 都明顯變慢(assembly 456 秒,上輪 289 秒;grid 860 秒)。\n- **根因未證實**。dot 指出缺少 P78 候選代次、排隊/server/bridge 起迄、abort 與 state 的完整時間線。\n\n## 要查的\n1. grid-trial-query 的前端中止時限是多少?被中止後,UI 會不會重試或回報錯誤,還是永遠停在非 ready?如果是後者,這是產品的強韌性問題,不只是測試問題。\n2. 在 CPU 節流下重現,記錄完整時間線(請求起迄、abort、trialState 變化)。\n3. 依結果修:產品端(中止後可恢復)或測試端(有界等待,比照 #197)。要附修前紅、修後綠、移除修正變紅。\n\n## 和合併的關係\n#188 只改 Q17 的 space 測試,沒碰這段。依 P-067 以同 head 正式重跑補足 canvas;這個間歇問題在 main 上另行追查,不擋 #188。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/209/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230","id":5835957380,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABW9mkhA","number":230,"title":"PF23/E1 oracle: distinguish R43 unit input from legal D7 fixture (P103)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-13T18:54:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T19:56:25Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"依 [P-103](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/227#issuecomment-6152304537) 回報原驗收文件與 SSOT 的差異；不自行修改公理或驗收數字。\n\n`geometry-core/panel-fill/amendment-r2.1-R43.md` §5 的 E1／PF23：F=[0,1000]×[0,300]、V向足跡[90,120]×[0,300]，兩端頂外輪廓，非boundary違I19；boundary側面未貼外輪廓，違D15/I20。P-103已決定原數字保留為R43純演算法單元oracle，另做真宿主E1-legal，驗收文字修正由後續帳本PR處理。\n\nPF-H #227已記錄分工。E1-legal的支撐幾何可行，但P-103指定secondary仍與I21衝突：兩支沿u的boundary使主支軸v，V向secondary不可平行主支軸。原生D7對照最後place第9行報V_PRIMARY_AXIS；相同幾何改primary通過。建議更正角色為primary，尚待裁決確認。一般placement僅作D7必要條件診斷，不冒充真衍生宿主。\n\n新場景R43聯集推導（未實跑）：兩端(0,27)/(273,300)兩側100/900，中間(27,50)/(100,273)10/20，(50,100)10/5；E1-legal五段，E2/E3中間合併而為三段。原算法三段／一段不变，不能搬用到含boundary的真場景。\n\n範圍：後續帳本PR釐清原驗收文件的算法／合法D7分工；不修改SSOT、不豁免I19/I20/I21。PF-H實作與三項正式驗收仍未完成。原生證據在#227分支 `tests/evidence/pfh-p103-role-20261014/`，含父層actual returncode、原回覆、場景與binary SHA。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"pu